{"10":[{"k":"p","t":"OPERATOR OPTIONAL SWITCH SETTINGS"},{"k":"p","t":"The option switches are located on the CPU board. The option switches and audio control can be reached through the back of the machine."},{"k":"p","t":"The following settings will assist you with your selections:"},{"k":"p","t":"OPTIONAL SWITCH SETTINGS"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 1 and 2 control the number of times the player may have his spaceship destroyed before the game is over. The following truth table lists these switch settings:"},{"k":"tr","t":"SWITCH 1   SWITCH 2   NUMBER OF SPACESHIPS"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   OFF   6"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   OFF   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   ON   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   ON   3"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 3 and 4 control the score at which one or two free spaceships are awarded according to the following truth table: FIRST FREE SECOND FREE"},{"k":"tr","t":"SWITCH 3 SWITCH 4   SHIP SCORE   SHIP SCORE"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   OFF   6,000   60,000"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   OFF   5,000   50,000"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   ON   4,000   40,000"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   ON   3,000   30,000"},{"k":"p","t":"SWITCH 5: OFF- 25\u00a2 PER GAME"},{"k":"p","t":"ON- 50\u00a2 PER GAME"},{"k":"p","t":"SWITCH 6: FACTORY SETTING; REMAINS IN OFF POSITION"},{"k":"p","t":"SWITCH 7: OFF- NO SOUND IN ATTRACT MODE ON- SOUND IN ATTRACT MODE"},{"k":"p","t":"SWITCH 8: OFF- UPRIGHT CABINET ON- COCKTAIL TABLE"}],"13":[{"k":"p","t":"CPU BOARD ASSEMBLY #50330013"},{"k":"p","t":"PARTS LIST"},{"k":"tr","t":"No. PART NUMBER   DESCRIPTION:   USAGE:"},{"k":"tr","t":"51. 50030007   100K OHM, %W., 5% RESISTOR   7"},{"k":"tr","t":"52. 50030010   470 OHM, %W., 5% RESISTOR   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"53. 50030086   33K OHM, \\W., 5% RESISTOR   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"54, 50030265   510K OHM, %W., 5% RESISTOR   6"},{"k":"tr","t":"55. 50030215   20K OHM, %W., 5% RESISTOR   16"},{"k":"tr","t":"56. 50030276   270K OHM, %W., 5% RESISTOR   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"57. 50030195   2K OHM, kW., 5% RESISTOR   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"58, 50030275   200K OHM, %W., 5% RESISTOR   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"59. 50030152   150 OHM, XW., 5% RESISTOR   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"60. 50150111   16-PIN SOLDER TRAIL SOCKET, LOW PROF.   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"61. 50150060   40-PIN SOLDER TRAIL SOCKET, LOW PROF.   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"62. 50150110   14-PIN SOLDER TRAIL SOCKET, LOW PROF.   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"63. 50130034   8 POSITION DIP SWITCH   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"64, 50150256   50-PIN PCB HEADER, AINSLEY #609-5007ES   2"},{"k":"tr","t":"65. 50210224   PRINTED CIRCUIT BOARD- CPU   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"66. 50100014   1N914 DIODE-D1-8   8"},{"k":"tr","t":"67. 50170050   INSULATED WIRE, 30AWG., (FOR MOD.)   30\""},{"k":"tr","t":"68. 50030148   39K OHM, %W., 5% RESISTOR   1"}]}